14
00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:27.312
* It feels so good it must be love *

15
00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:30.254
* It's everything that I've been dreaming of *

16
00:01:30.323 --> 00:01:32.154
* I give up, I give in *

17
00:01:32.225 --> 00:01:34.159
